      "title": "Separate target composition from replacement identity",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "IMAGE 1 supplies the scene and pose; IMAGE 2 supplies the entire replacement person and outfit. Replace the entire person in IMAGE 1 with the person from IMAGE 2, including their recognizable face, hair, body appearance, complete outfit and accessories. Dress them entirely in IMAGE 2's garments, preserving the neckline, sleeves, fabric, colors and garment length, fitted naturally to the target pose. Replace every original garment and accessory rather than combining the two outfits. Match IMAGE 1's exact pose, head size, screen position, camera distance, expression and framing. Preserve its room, objects and occlusions. Illuminate the replacement with the target scene's light direction, exposure, color temperature, reflected light and contact shadows. Match the photograph's focus, grain and natural skin texture."
      ]
    },
